
	
	nsp sedumi 28 Janv 2009
	-----------------------
	

	This is a port to nsp of the Sedumi toolbox.
	The port started with SeDuMi 1.1

	1.1/ To compile the toolbox on Linux 

	- start nsp 
	- execute the builder.sce file 
	
        /usr/local/src/nsp2/bin/nsp -nw 
	-nsp->exec builder.sce 

	1.2/ To compile the toolbox on windows 
	is not necessary. A dll is already present 
	in the distribution and was obtained by 
	cross compilation on a Linux system.

	2/ To load the toolbox use 
	-nsp->exec loader.sce

	3/ Basic tests are available in tests.

	4/ The repository macros/conversion 
	contains some macros that can be used 
	to convert problems from other representations
	to sedumi representation 

	Jean-Philippe Chancelier 
	Enpc/Cermics
	28 Janv 2009

	
